L409: Anneka E Antoniak
L410: School of Sport, Exercise and Rehabilitation Sciences, University of Birmingham, Edgbaston,
L411: Birmingham, B15 2TT, UK
L412: Email: aea423@bham.ac.uk
L413: Telephone number: +44 121 371 3234
