L847: **BMJ Open**
L848: Figure 1: Study flow chart
L849: Upon reading full text articles, it became clear that there were 2 separate groups of interventions; studies in
L850: which all participants took part in RET and the intervention arm was supplemented with vitamin D3; studies in
L851: which all participants were supplemented with vitamin D3 and the intervention arm took part in RET; and
L852: studies using a combination of the 2 interventions (Table 2).
