L3180: **BMJ Open**
L3181: ### **The effect of combined resistance exercise training and vitamin D3** **supplementation on musculoskeletal health and function in older adults: A** **systematic review and meta-analysis**
L3182: **AUTHORS**
L3183: Anneka E Antoniak [1] and Carolyn A Greig [1,2]
L3184: 1School of Sport, Exercise and Rehabilitation Sciences, 2MRC-Arthritis Research UK Centre
L3185: for Musculoskeletal Ageing and Health, University of Birmingham, Edgbaston, Birmingham,
L3186: B15 2TT, UK
L3187: **Corresponding author**
L3188: Anneka E Antoniak
L3189: School of Sport, Exercise and Rehabilitation Sciences, University of Birmingham, Edgbaston,
L3190: Birmingham, B15 2TT, UK
L3191: Email: aea423@bham.ac.uk
L3192: Telephone number: +44 121 371 3234
L3193: **Keywords:** Vitamin D, exercise, older adults, randomized controlled trial, systematic review
